--- !u!114 &155532098
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 155532096}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aec1ad371461c9c42960db4bddc918b6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Beyond.Runtime::Beyond.Interaction.JournalNote
  title: Field Journal - Day 19
  body: 'The signal came back last night. Same pattern, same frequency, and Hale swears it isn''t terrestrial. He wants to take the camp radio apart and rebuild it as a receiver.


    I told him we can''t afford to lose contact with Site Control. He did it anyway.


    I''ve hidden the spare battery out by the big boulder on the far side of the trail, past the next bend, so he can''t cannibalise that too.


    The camp is just ahead.


    -  M. Ilves'
