  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Beyond.Runtime::Beyond.Interaction.JournalNote
  title: Expedition Notice
  body: 'MERIDIAN EXPEDITION  -  AUTHORISED PERSONNEL ONLY


    Base camp is north-east of this point. Follow the orange trail markers.


    Radio check-ins at 06:00 and 18:00. If a check-in is missed for more than 48 hours, do NOT proceed alone. Contact Site Control.


    -  R. Okafor, Logistics'
